{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Apostles of the Covenant have occupied cities and strongholds across the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will play as a Knight of the Crimson Roc, embarking on a journey to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">defend your homeland and fight against the heavens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/extras/73f9467f0120a16310dc663ccb66cff8.poster.avif?t=1757577346\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/extras/73f9467f0120a16310dc663ccb66cff8.webm?t=1757577346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/extras/73f9467f0120a16310dc663ccb66cff8.mp4?t=1757577346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Press the directional keys to take the initiative and launch attacks against them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Engage in fierce battles to reclaim the cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You must prove to the heavens that the Knights of the Crimson Roc are not incompetent\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">you have the right to protect Skyreach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Red Pegasus</strong></i><strong> is a blade-clashing action RPG.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(The trial version includes Chapter 1 content)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With just the &quot;Attack&quot; and &quot;Dodge&quot; buttons combined with directional inputs, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">you can execute over 50 different combo skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each of the 50+ skills can engage enemies in over 20 types of blade-clashing states, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">with each attack generating 20 \u00d7 50 = 1,000+ possible blade-clashing scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/extras/3cb2bd44fb8c911231dd13c0ee9d6a51.poster.avif?t=1757577346\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/extras/3cb2bd44fb8c911231dd13c0ee9d6a51.webm?t=1757577346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/extras/3cb2bd44fb8c911231dd13c0ee9d6a51.mp4?t=1757577346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/extras/49384b3daa7f9a6b3bb5a8c958e2cc79.poster.avif?t=1757577346\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/extras/49384b3daa7f9a6b3bb5a8c958e2cc79.webm?t=1757577346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/extras/49384b3daa7f9a6b3bb5a8c958e2cc79.mp4?t=1757577346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On this vast land, to defy the gods with a mortal body and embark on the path of challenging the heavens\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">How terrifying and sorrowful is it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The power that decaying beings can never obtain\u2014have you truly awakened to it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Great change arises from tremendous collision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every clash awakens the divine will slumbering deep within your blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This blade, raised against the sky.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This body, conceals a spark of god-slaying</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991080?t=1757577346","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991080?t=1757577346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/cadd6770c367af5b1f6b69df9bafe8756f871b57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757577346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991080/cadd6770c367af5b1f6b69df9bafe8756f871b57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757577346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Apostles of the Covenant have occupied cities and strongholds across the continent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will play as a Knight of the Crimson Roc, embarking on a journey to </p><p class=\"bb_paragrap